{"id":"steam-1048450","steam":1048450,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Probably Nothing","summary":"Wake on a floating island and find the way home with your friends. Gather, craft and build on Haven, hunt across islands linked by magic teleporters, help Jamie run his farm, and unwind at the festival square and The Beast coaster.","about":"Probably Nothing is a cozy co-op survival adventure made for spending time with friends. You start on Haven, a forest island floating in the sky, with a few tools and a long list of questions.\n\n• \nGather wood, stone, fiber and ore, then craft tools, weapons and gear as you learn new recipes.\n• \nBuild your base on Haven and survive a full day and night cycle — the nights are not as quiet as they seem.\n• \nTravel by teleporter to other islands, each with its own look, creatures and ores to find.\n• \nHunt deer, stags and worse; every animal leaves something useful behind.\n• \nHelp Jamie on his farm and work toward opening his shop.\n• \nTake a break at the festival square for a game of bingo, or ride The Beast, the island's wooden roller coaster.\n• \nPlay alone or with friends; your world, progress and time of day are saved.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048450/bddcec99d6ef72307afe8711e04ab343f111071f/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793234228","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048450/b3fc696d9048bf05a29e843bd311a15cba046da3/header.jpg?t=1793234228","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048450/bf12efbba288d6f18d81ccbc6f898dbbade86a94/library_hero.jpg?t=1793234228","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048450/b3fc696d9048bf05a29e843bd311a15cba046da3/header.jpg?t=1793234228","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1048450/8184b781a94ca04252ccbbdfe806df849202ebe9/ss_8184b781a94ca04252ccbbdfe